{"info": {"address1": "Continental Building", "address2": "135, Dr. Annie Besant Road Worli", "city": "Mumbai", "zip": "400018", "country": "India", "phone": "91 22 7154 1895", "fax": "91 22 2674 3422", "website": "https://zeelearn.com", "industry": "Education & Training Services", "industryKey": "education-training-services", "industryDisp": "Education & Training Services", "sector": "Consumer Defensive", "sectorKey": "consumer-defensive", "sectorDisp": "Consumer Defensive", "longBusinessSummary": "Zee Learn Limited, together with its subsidiaries, operates in the education industry in India. It operates through Educational; Construction and Leasing for Education; and Training Manpower and Related Activities segments. The company operates Kidzee, a chain of pre-schools in various cities; Mount Litera World Preschool, an international standard preschool; Mount Litera Zee Schools, a chain of schools in the private-unaided category schools; and Mount Litera School International, a co-educational day school. It also operates Zee Institute of Creative Art, a classical and digital animation training academy that trains youth in classical 2D, modern 3D animation, visual effect, and gaming, as well as covers various stages of visualization, pre-production, production, and post-production activities; Zee Institute of Media Arts that offers media education in the field of film making, direction, acting, voicing and TV presentation, screenwriting, executive producer, ad filmmaking, cinematography, sound recording, editing, TV journalism, autodesk smoke and flame, and other related areas; ZNius, a curriculum designed to redefine K-12 education; and LIBERIUM, a human resource management, skilling, and training company. In addition, the company provides consultancy and advisory services in the field of human resources, such as manpower placement, recruitment, selection, business process, and others; and E-Learning online education and testing services. Further, it is involved in the construction and leasing of properties for commercial use. Zee Learn Limited was incorporated in 2010 and is based in Mumbai, India.", "fullTimeEmployees": 397, "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Manish  Rastogi", "age": 58, "title": "CEO & Whole-Time Director", "yearBorn": 1967, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 23374296, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Anil Rambhuprasad Gupta", "title": "Company Secretary, Compliance Officer & Investor Relations Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Rakesh  Chaturvedi", "title": "Chief Financial Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Mayank  Jain Bcom", "title": "Chief Operating Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Abha  Nair", "age": 53, "title": "Head of Human Resources", "yearBorn": 1972, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Santosh  Gupta Mca, Mcom", "age": 48, "title": "Head of Information Technology", "yearBorn": 1977, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Puspita Soumitra Chattopadhyay", "age": 49, "title": "Chief Academic Officer", "yearBorn": 1976, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Balasubramaniam  Durgavarjhula", "age": 54, "title": "Business Head", "yearBorn": 1971, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Hari Swaroop Goyal", "age": 59, "title": "Financial Controller", "yearBorn": 1966, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}], "compensationAsOfEpochDate": 1767139200, "executiveTeam": [], "maxAge": 86400, "priceHint": 2, "previousClose": 5.81, "open": 5.81, "dayLow": 5.76, "dayHigh": 6.5, "regularMarketPreviousClose": 5.81, "regularMarketO